| Training (click trains) | 60 / 60 | 0.0% | 3.3% | 1.7% |
| Test (grooves, new seeds) | 60 / 60 | 0.0% | 0.0% | 0.0% |
| Real drum stems | 12 / 12 | 0.0% | 0.0% | 0.0% |

